Unlocks Arcane Discipline: Medium.</description>
    <baseCost>700</baseCost>
    <techLevel>Neolithic</techLevel>
    <tab>MFV_Arcane</tab>
    <requiredResearchBuilding>MFV_ArcaneResearchBench</requiredResearchBuilding>
